  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0f1b918fc5de4f448a14402d08e1f332, type: 3}
  m_Name: StoryContent
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryContent
  introductionText:
  - 'Stable port to Qurotema. All readings active.

    Vision coming in for RO.'
  - Stabilizing comms. Gates are forcing one-way only channel.
  - All set. We'll keep watch and study Qurotema alongside you, Operator.
  - Activating vessel control module.
  - Di, make Sino proud.
  monolithText:
  - 'Confirming i-tema characters on visual feed.

    Loading up local translations
    to compare.'
  - 'Huh, this is our only translated entry.

    "The night will flow when black
    time''s sand knows foreign touch."'
  - 'The writing on the gates shares two of those words, "Quro" and "Tema".

    Our
    station''s name in its original context.'
  - 'Those are our only translations, this isn''t new information.

    Find more
    Monoliths, it''ll help us fill a database for linguistic analysis.'
  instrumentText:
  - Faint s.gnal n... your vessel's current pos.tion.
  - L.st v..ual fe.d. St..l getting al. oth.r r.adings. Ke.p up the research.
  - Co..ection is bec.ming too unreli.ble. Begin..ng pu.l, s.ay c.lm.
  endText:
  - Lo.ing co..ection fas., Di, wh.t's ..ing on?
  - RO? Di? B.dy .. ... la... .. ..resp.n.ive. ........ ret.r. pro.ocol ...........
    .. .. ... .....cit.te.
  - Qur..ema .. ...., .... ... ..... ... .... ves.el .. .. ... vo.d.
  - Aban.on.ng ...... ... s..ry. ... ... ..... ...... ..... ... ......
  uniqueText:
  - 'Monolith visual confirmed. There should be writing projecting from it.

    Maybe
    it needs to be activated?'
  - 'Confirming new reading.

    Hmm. Nothing like this in Sino''s notes.'
  - Press escape again to quit.
  monolithGraphics:
